monitor/monitor_engine.py — Layer 1 monitoring engine.

FIX-1: normalize ts on every detection before emission.
  - Firewall events carry date + time strings; converted to epoch ts.
  - Eventlog events carry ISO timestamp string; converted to epoch ts.
  - Sensor detections already carry numeric ts; unchanged.
"""

